  "changelog": "Initial release of guaikei\u6296\u97f3\u53d1\u73b0 skill.\n\n- Enables keyword search, creator post fetching, comment analysis, and real-time hot topic queries for Douyin.\n- Provides structured JSON output, suitable for content planning, competitor analysis, and public sentiment monitoring.\n- Supports intent recognition from natural user input, even if \"Douyin\" is not explicitly mentioned.\n- Implements strict token error handling with compliance-focused messaging; does not output marketing content or contact details at runtime.\n- No third-party dependencies; requires only Node.js \u2265 16.14 and a valid GUAIKEI_API_TOKEN environment variable.\n- Limits: fetches up to 10,000 items per request, handles only public Douyin data, and does not support publishing, editing, or watermark removal.",
